Subject: [PATCH v2 03/13] KVM: selftests: Fudge around an apparent gcc bug in
 arm64's PMU test
In-Reply-To: <20240911204158.2034295-1-seanjc@google.com>
References: <20240911204158.2034295-1-seanjc@google.com>
